      "text": "Mistral Large 4 is the fourth-generation flagship large language model from Mistral AI, a Paris-based startup. It is a 1-trillion-parameter mixture-of-experts (MoE) model with 49 billion active parameters per forward pass, designed for native multimodal input and hybrid instruction-following and reasoning tasks. Trained from scratch on a 3,800-GPU NVIDIA Grace Blackwell cluster in Mistral's own European datacenters, it supports over 160 languages and is offered via API at $1.36 per million tokens with a commitment to release open weights. The model represents Mistral's bid to compete with DeepSeek, Qwen, and US frontier labs while emphasizing European data sovereignty."
